},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An initialized raster tile source."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" documentation for more information about tile"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"t